{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-03 18:42:22 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"scan_only\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/shared/execution_context.py\", \"byte_size\": 7745, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 1, \"line_count\": 194, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"shared/execution_context.py\", \"sha256\": \"12d7aee9a33a1ffc5cf0c1572e392d74389e6d42fd76eb920759667b01f8f465\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-03T18:42:22.360941Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-03T18:42:22.377066+00:00_6347f166", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T18:42:22.377094+00:00"}
