on test suite PASSING (35/35 tests) - Zero regressions from Stages 4-6 work. Stages 1-3 (schema/storage/hashing) + Stage 4 (session) + Stage 5 (failure context) all validated clean. Stage 6 documentation comprehensive and production-ready.\", \"meta\": {\"content_type\": \"log\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"priority\": \"medium\", \"reasoning\": \"{\\\"how\\\": \\\"Executed pytest on 5 test files covering schema, storage, hashing, session integration, and failure priority logic\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Full foundation test suite (stages 1-5) execution and results verification\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Must validate no regressions before final grading decision\\\"}\", \"regressions\": \"zero\", \"stage4_tests\": \"5/5\", \"stage5_tests\": \"6/6\", \"stage6_tests\": \"0/6_blocked\", \"test_suite_results\": \"35/35_pass\"}, \"priority\": \"medium\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-03 19:35:55 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Foundation test suite PASSING (35/35 tests) - Zero regressions from Stages 4-6 work. Stages 1-3 (schema/storage/hashing) + Stage 4 (session) + Stage 5 (failure context) all validated clean. Stage 6 documentation comprehensive and production-ready.   reasoning={\\\"how\\\": \\\"Executed pytest on 5 test files covering schema, storage, hashing, session integration, and failure priority logic\\\", \\\"what\\\": \\\"Full foundation test suite (stages 1-5) execution and results verification\\\", \\\"why\\\": \\\"Must validate no regressions before final grading decision\\\"}; regressions=zero; stage4_tests=5/5; stage5_tests=6/6; stage6_tests=0/6_blocked; test_suite_results=35/35_pass; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-03 19:35:55 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"ReviewAgent\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 1.0, \"emoji\": \"\\u2139\\ufe0f\", \"id\": \"487fec63ee305725be0c1033a68b1b17\", \"message\": \"Code review complete - Stage 4 (5/5 tests pass), Stage 5 (6/6 tests pass) implementati