{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 05:35:03 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 16052, \"byte_start\": 15290, \"content\": \"                        \\\"include_metadata\\\": include_metadata,\\n                        \\\"backend\\\": \\\"database\\\"\\n                    },\\n                    response=response,\\n                    compact_mode=compact,\\n                    page_size=page_size\\n                )\\n\\n            return await _READ_RECENT_HELPER.formatter.finalize_tool_response(\\n                response, format, \\\"read_recent\\\"\\n            )\\n\\n    # File-based fallback with pagination\\n    # Read more lines than needed to account for filtering\\n    fetch_limit = page_size * 3  # Fetch 3x to account for filter reductions\\n    all_lines = await read_tail(\\n        _progress_log_path(project),\\n        fetch_limit,\\n        repo_root=Path(project.get(\\\"root\\\") or settings.project_root).resolve(),\\n\", \"line_end\": 400, \"line_start\": 382}, \"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/tools/read_recent.py\", \"byte_size\": 22566, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 3, \"line_count\": 578, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"tools/read_recent.py\", \"sha256\": \"05a78575b68b7d1d47398085371387d4c6f8fcc42287f3870b72f964a4344dce\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-04T05:35:03.034293Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T05:35:03.041031+00:00_8871976c", "timestamp": "202