{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 05:36:39 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 13911, \"byte_start\": 13406, \"content\": \"                if healing_applied:\\n                    response[\\\"parameter_healing\\\"] = {\\n                        \\\"applied\\\": True,\\n                        \\\"messages\\\": healing_messages,\\n                        \\\"original_parameters\\\": {\\\"n\\\": healed_params[\\\"n\\\"], \\\"page\\\": healed_params[\\\"page\\\"], \\\"page_size\\\": healed_params[\\\"page_size\\\"]}\\n                    }\\n                return await _READ_RECENT_HELPER.formatter.finalize_tool_response(\\n                    response, format, \\\"read_recent\\\"\\n                )\\n\", \"line_end\": 350, \"line_start\": 342}, \"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/tools/read_recent.py\", \"byte_size\": 22566, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 3, \"line_count\": 578, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"tools/read_recent.py\", \"sha256\": \"05a78575b68b7d1d47398085371387d4c6f8fcc42287f3870b72f964a4344dce\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-04T05:36:39.455432Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T05:36:39.461373+00:00_13b0e1dd", "timestamp": "2026-01-04T05:36:39.461406+00:00"}
