{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 05:56:15 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/research/RESEARCH_TOOL_LOGGING_ARCH_20260104_0550.md\", \"error\": \"file not found\", \"mode\": \"chunk\", \"ok\": false, \"reminders\": [], \"repo_relative_path\": \".scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/research/RESEARCH_TOOL_LOGGING_ARCH_20260104_0550.md\"}; timestamp=2026-01-04T05:56:15.180474Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T05:56:15.187293+00:00_2d49e473", "timestamp": "2026-01-04T05:56:15.187320+00:00"}
