{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 05:56:39 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 10994, \"byte_start\": 10224, \"content\": \"\\n**Key Design Decisions:**\\n1. **JSONL + SQL Dual Write:** Maintain JSONL for backward compatibility, add SQL for analytics\\n2. **Session-First Design:** All tool calls linked to session_id for traceability\\n3. **No Reminders:** Tool logs are audit trails, not work logs\\u2014reminder system disabled\\n4. **Direct Writing:** Bypass append_entry completely to eliminate recursion\\n5. **WAL Safety:** Reuse existing atomic write infrastructure for crash safety\\n\\n**Implementation Estimate:**\\n- SQL schema: 1 hour\\n- Direct writer module: 2-3 hours\\n- finalize_tool_response update: 1 hour\\n- Testing and validation: 2-3 hours\\n- **Total: ~8 hours (1 development day)**\\n\\n---\\n**Research Complete:** 2026-01-04 05:51:00 UTC\\n**Next Phase:** Architecture design and implementation planning\\n\", \"line_end\": 218, \"line_start\": 201}, \"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/research/RESEARCH_TOOL_LOGGING_ARCH_20260104_0550.md\", \"byte_size\": 10994, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 2, \"line_count\": 218, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/research/RESEARCH_TOOL_LOGGING_ARCH_20260104_0550.md\", \"sha256\": \"98cf559359a4fcbff41084eff0afca63cd25ca18491e9c0817bdb1a96810d639\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-04T05:56:39.078898Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T05:56:39.085495+00:00_afd62393", "timestamp": "2026-01-04T05:56:39.085531+00:00"}
