{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 05:56:46 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"chunk\": {\"byte_end\": 16689, \"byte_start\": 15862, \"content\": \"async def append_line(\\n    path: Path,\\n    line: str,\\n    use_wal: bool = True,\\n    repo_root: Optional[Path] = None,\\n    context: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None,\\n) -> None:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    Bulletproof append a single line to the provided file path.\\n\\n    Args:\\n        path: File path to append to\\n        line: Line content to append\\n        use_wal: Whether to use Write-Ahead Log for crash safety\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    path = _ensure_safe_path(\\n        path,\\n        operation=\\\"append\\\",\\n        context=context or {\\\"component\\\": \\\"logs\\\"},\\n        repo_root=repo_root,\\n    )\\n    await ensure_parent(path, repo_root=repo_root, context=context)\\n\\n    if use_wal:\\n        await asyncio.to_thread(_write_line_with_wal, path, line, repo_root, context)\\n    else:\\n        await asyncio.to_thread(_write_line, path, line, True, repo_root, context)\\n\\n\", \"line_end\": 543, \"line_start\": 516}, \"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"line_range\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/utils/files.py\", \"byte_size\": 24257, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 4, \"line_count\": 784, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"utils/files.py\", \"sha256\": \"ec11343c25d1f3f37b69d201a920c7e09a3eff0fe3a28f515d0b00d3f5481d1c\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-04T05:56:46.369979Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T05:56:46.377335+00:00_bfc7ef97", "timestamp": "2026-01-04T05:56:46.377374+00:00"}
