{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-04 11:59:03 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Tool call: read_file | format_requested=readable; response_data={\"frontmatter\": {}, \"frontmatter_byte_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_line_count\": 0, \"frontmatter_raw\": \"\", \"has_frontmatter\": false, \"mode\": \"scan_only\", \"ok\": true, \"reminders\": [{\"category\": \"context\", \"context\": \"Entries:    Last: \", \"emoji\": \"\\ud83c\\udfaf\", \"level\": \"info\", \"message\": \"Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement\", \"score\": 3, \"tone\": \"neutral\"}], \"scan\": {\"absolute_path\": \"/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/tests/test_tool_logger.py\", \"byte_size\": 12667, \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"estimated_chunk_count\": 2, \"line_count\": 374, \"newline_type\": \"LF\", \"repo_relative_path\": \"tests/test_tool_logger.py\", \"sha256\": \"86d695502f7fa008f7978d22519c13fc107449e9360147d598d0573d651c85c7\"}}; timestamp=2026-01-04T11:59:03.692004Z; tool=read_file; priority=medium; log_type=tool_logs; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_tool_output_refinement/TOOL_LOG.jsonl", "id": "2026-01-04T11:59:03.698684+00:00_f0f98980", "timestamp": "2026-01-04T11:59:03.698712+00:00"}
