\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-05 00:42:09 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"Orchestrator\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 0.98, \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"id\": \"ad2d3651433b04fd293e7ec1d793acf0\", \"message\": \"Research Complete - REAL SOLUTION FOUND: asyncio.create_task() creates weak references. When created in tool functions (local scope), tasks get garbage collected when function returns. Solution: Module-level background_tasks = set() in server.py with task.add_done_callback(background_tasks.discard) pattern. Prevents GC while avoiding memory leaks. 18 web searches conducted, 98% confidence.\", \"meta\": {\"confidence\": \"0.98\", \"content_type\": \"log\", \"implementation_location\": \"server.py_module_level\", \"log_type\": \"progress\", \"priority\": \"medium\", \"root_cause\": \"weak_references_garbage_collected\", \"solution\": \"background_tasks_set\", \"web_searches\": \"18\"}, \"priority\": \"medium\", \"raw_line\": \"[\\u2705] [2026-01-04 23:31:19 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_tool_output_refinement] Research Complete - REAL SOLUTION FOUND: asyncio.create_task() creates weak references. When created in tool functions (local scope), tasks get garbage collected when function returns. Solution: Module-level background_tasks = set() in server.py with task.add_done_callback(background_tasks.discard) pattern. Prevents GC while avoiding memory leaks. 18 web searches conducted, 98% confidence.   confidence=0.98; implementation_location=server.py_module_level; root_cause=weak_references_garbage_collected; solution=background_tasks_set; web_searches=18; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\", \"ts\": \"2026-01-04 23:31:20 UTC\"}, {\"agent\": \"ResearchAgent\", \"category\": null, \"confidence\": 0.95, \"emoji\": \"\\u2705\", \"id\": \"fbf55b0b2d313f098fbd621e626904a1\", \"message\": \"RESEARCH PHASE COMPLETE - Solution identified and validated: Module-level background_tasks set with done callback pattern from official Python docs\", \"meta\": 